          "relation_type": "conclusion_triggers_response",
          "evidence_unit_ids": [
            "v7u_N000398"
          ],
          "source_quote": "She will then need to assess the systems and controls that are in place to determine if they are commensurate with the specific risks of money laundering and terrorist financing that the bank faces."
        },
